  decl_external_err_lib_file.pcpp - break step of decl_external.pcpp:
  a file name as the library: external takes a name such as lib_plain

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\decl_external_err_lib_file.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\decl_external_err_lib_file.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
